<section class="three-tool-knowledge" id="gold-deep-guide" aria-labelledby="gold-guide-heading">
 <h2 id="gold-guide-heading">Gold Zakat calculator: purity, jewellery, Nisab and a complete guide</h2>
 <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> For a gold item's fine-metal estimate, multiply its metal weight by <strong>karat ÷ 24</strong>, then by a verified <strong>24k gold price per gram</strong>. Whether the resulting value is zakatable depends on your eligible wealth, the applicable Nisab and hawl, and jewellery rulings. The calculator above supports multiple items without assuming an automatic duty.</p>
